                55 => ['What kind of opponent does Saitama struggle to find in One-Punch Man?', 'His enormous strength means Saitama rarely finds a worthy opponent.', ['One strong enough to challenge him', 'One who can read', 'One who wears glasses', 'One from Japan']],
